note: Blocker, from docs/licences.md: the text comes from YouTube comments, Stack Overflow responses, Twitter and Reddit, and platform terms need a look before the corpus is used, so this recipe stays eval-only and no default-tier recipe is checked in.
note: The CC BY 4.0 statement covers the annotations and the collection as the publisher states them; it does not settle the platform terms of the source text, which remain unresolved.
note: Attribution: Derczynski, Nichols, van Erp and Limsopatham, Results of the WNUT2017 Shared Task on Novel and Emerging Entity Recognition, EMNLP 2017 workshop.
